        "target": "体积倍数"
      },
      "group": null,
      "prompt": "同质量铁块和铝块，密度分别为7.8和2.7克/厘米$^3$。铝块体积是铁块的几倍？",
      "figureRefs": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "o3",
          "text": "$\\frac{26}{9}-1$",
          "value": "\\frac{26}{9}-1",
          "misconception": "“是几倍”不需要在体积比上再减1。"
        },
        {
          "id": "o1",
          "text": "$\\frac{9}{26}$",
          "value": "\\frac{9}{26}",
          "misconception": "把铝与铁的体积比颠倒了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "o2",
          "text": "$\\frac{26}{9}$",
          "value": "\\frac{26}{9}"
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionId": "o2",
      "explanation": "$V_{\\text{铝}}/V_{\\text{铁}}=\\rho_{\\text{铁}}/\\rho_{\\text{铝}}=7.8/2.7=\\frac{26}{9}$。",
      "verification": {
        "kind": "numeric",
        "expected": "\\frac{26}{9}"
      }
    },
